msgid ""
"You can short the pads in any particular way (either with a wire, solder "
"joint, or something else). Detailed instructions are available on the `Revo "
"Mini LibrePilot Wiki "
"<https://librepilot.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/LPDOC/pages/29622291/Recover+board+using+DFU>`__."
