" device via USB first, and then short the pads if using a wire. Once you "
"have the device in DFU mode and connected to your machine continue with the "
"following steps to :ref:`load ArduPilot firmware onto ChibiOS boards "
"<common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards>`."
msgstr ""
"您可以用任何方式短接焊盘（导线、焊接或其他方法）。详细说明可在 `Revo Mini LibrePilot Wiki "
"<https://librepilot.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/LPDOC/pages/29622291/Recover+board+using+DFU>`__"
" 找到。使用细导线是短接设备最简单的方式。您也可以先通过 USB 给设备供电，然后再用导线短接焊盘。将设备置于 DFU "
"模式并连接到计算机后，继续按以下步骤操作：:ref:`将 ArduPilot 固件加载到 ChibiOS 板子 <common-loading-"
"firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards>`。"

